  "readme": "# Notion Skills\n\nAgent skills for working with [Notion](https://notion.so).\n\n## Install\n\nWe recommend the [skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills).\n\n```bash\n# Install all skills\nnpx skills add makenotion/skills\n\n# Install a specific skill\nnpx skills add makenotion/skills --skill notion-cli\n```\n\n## Available Skills\n\n| Skill | Description |\n| ----- | ----------- |\n| `notion-cli` | Install and use the Notion CLI (`ntn`) for workers, public API requests, and file uploads. |\n| `notion-apps` | Scaffold and build Notion Apps, including workflows and database syncs. |\n",
  "readmeHtml": "<h1>Notion Skills</h1>\n<p>Agent skills for working with <a href=\"https://notion.so\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Notion</a>.</p>\n<h2>Install</h2>\n<p>We recommend the <a href=\"https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">skills CLI</a>.</p>\n<pre><code>\n# Install all skills\n\nnpx skills add makenotion/skills\n\n\n\n# Install a specific skill\n\nnpx skills add makenotion/skills --skill notion-cli\n\n</code></pre>\n<h2>Available Skills</h2>\n<p>| Skill | Description |</p>\n<p>| ----- | ----------- |</p>\n<p>| <code>notion-cli</code> | Install and use the Notion CLI (<code>ntn</code>) for workers, public API requests, and file uploads. |</p>\n<p>| <code>notion-apps</code> | Scaffold and build Notion Apps, including workflows and database syncs. |</p>",
